{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Expand your fleet</strong> by <strong>raiding other spaceships</strong> in this <strong>action packed space-themed shooter</strong> with both <strong>First-Person &amp; Spaceship Combat</strong> or <strong>explore galaxies</strong> noone has been before... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544730/extras/Testt.png?t=1740585936\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544730/extras/ProjectMind03-APNG01.png?t=1740585936\" />Destroy the aldions` spaceships before they harm your fleet... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544730/extras/ExpandYOurFleet.png?t=1740585936\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544730/extras/ProjectMind02-APNG01.png?t=1740585936\" />Find a way into hostile motherships and <strong>scavange WEAPONS</strong>,\u00a0<strong>PERKS\u00a0</strong>or<strong> PARTS</strong>\u00a0to build own\u00a0<strong><i>SPACESHIPS</i></strong>... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544730/extras/UseYourGadtes.png?t=1740585936\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544730/extras/ProjectMind04-APNG01.png?t=1740585936\" />Reclaim implants to <strong>unlock new ABILITIES</strong> or get protection by<strong>  your SHIELD</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544730/extras/ExplorePlanets.png?t=1740585936\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544730/extras/ProjectMind01-APNG06__1_.png?t=1740585936\" />Need a brake from destroying Aldions?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just launch your spaceship and discover galaxies noone has been before... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ABOUT PROJECT MIND:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The scientific project develops implants which improve your mind in certain aspects.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The aldions consider this project a unnatural, dangerous venture and try everything to cancle it.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That\u2019s why they infiltrate the spaceship of project mind and steal all data and implants necessary to keep the project alive...</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3544730?t=1740585936","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3544730?t=1740585936","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544730/dc6861bd34c7c3540267ca02b0c9e6d0c20d64b9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740585936","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544730/dc6861bd34c7c3540267ca02b0c9e6d0c20d64b9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740585936","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Expand your fleet</strong> by <strong>raiding other spaceships</strong> in this <strong>action packed space-themed shooter</strong> with both <strong>First-Person &amp; Spaceship Combat</strong> or <strong>explore galaxies</strong> noone has been before... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.stea